      "source": "Create an <a href=\"OriginTrackedValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>OriginTrackedValue</code></a> containing the specified <code>value</code> and\n<code>origin</code>. If the source value implements <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/CharSequence.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>CharSequence</code></a> then so will\nthe resulting <a href=\"OriginTrackedValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>OriginTrackedValue</code></a>.",
